WEBVTT

00:06:57.199 --> 00:07:00.976
are actually complex things
made by other people,

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:02.558
and you can understand them.

00:07:03.137 --> 00:07:07.086
Number five: Two-parter.

00:07:07.110 --> 00:07:09.222
Break the Digital
Millennium Copyright Act.

00:07:09.246 --> 00:07:11.532
(Laughter)

00:07:11.556 --> 00:07:15.342
There are laws beyond safety regulations

00:07:15.366 --> 00:07:18.081
that attempt to limit
how we can interact with the things

00:07:18.105 --> 00:07:20.501
that we own -- in this case,
digital media.

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:23.135
It's a very simple exercise:

00:07:23.159 --> 00:07:27.564
Buy a song on iTunes, write it to a CD,

00:07:27.588 --> 00:07:31.437
then rip the CD to an MP3,
and play it on your very same computer.